    <!-- ESDE Setup Wizard Content -->
    <string name="esde_setup_welcome_content">Before using ES-DE with Jarngreipr, you\'ll need to follow these steps\n\n1. Grant storage permissions\n2. Select ES-DE scripts folder\n3. Create script files\n4. Select downloaded media folder\n5. Enable scripts in ES-DE\n\nIf you\'re familiar with ES-DE Companion, this is the exact same process.</string>
    <string name="esde_setup_permissions_content">Storage access is required to create scripts and access media.\n\nTap \'Grant Permission\' to open settings. The wizard will continue once granted.</string>
    <string name="esde_setup_permissions_granted_content">The app can now manage scripts and media files.</string>
    <string name="esde_setup_scripts_folder_content">Select your ES-DE scripts folder (typically ~/ES-DE/scripts).\n\nTap \'Select Folder\' to choose, or \'Use Default\' for the standard internal storage path.</string>
    <string name="esde_setup_create_scripts_content">Now we will create the necessary integration scripts in your selected folder.\n\nTap \'Create Scripts\' to proceed, or \'Skip\' if they already exist.</string>
    <string name="esde_setup_media_folder_content">Select your ES-DE downloaded_media folder.\n\nDefault path:\n/ES-DE/downloaded_media\n\nTap \'Select Folder\' to choose, or \'Use Default\' for internal storage.</string>
    <string name="esde_setup_enable_scripts_content">Final step! Enable these settings in ES-DE\n\n1. Open ES-DE Menu (START)\n2. Go to Other Settings\n3. Toggle ON \'Custom Event Scripts\'\n4. Toggle ON \'Browsing Custom Events\'</string>
    <string name="esde_setup_complete_content">You can now switch between ES-DE and any other type of wallpaper.\n\nShout out to @RobZombie9043 for ES-DE Companion and the beauty of open source :)</string>

    <!-- ESDE Setup Wizard Warnings -->
    <string name="esde_setup_warning_scripts_path">Warning: This doesn\'t look like the ES-DE scripts folder.\n\nSelected: %1$s\n\nES-DE may not find the scripts in this location.\n\nContinue anyway?</string>
    <string name="esde_setup_warning_media_path">Warning: This doesn\'t look like the ES-DE downloaded_media folder.\n\nSelected: %1$s\n\nArtwork may not display correctly.\n\nContinue anyway?</string>
    <string name="esde_setup_warning_scripts_missing">Warning: Required scripts are missing from this folder.\n\nWithout these, the app cannot receive game information from ES-DE.\n\nContinue anyway?</string>

